        "lede": "Virtual staging is a digital marketing technique for real estate: an interior designer places 3D models of furniture and decor into photos of empty rooms or an occupied home so buyers can imagine living there, with no physical furniture delivered. DC's professional buyers decide on their phones, so Bella's designers stage Washington-area listings in 24 to 48 hours, from {price:virtual-staging} a photo.",
